To start to program first navigate to /client/imgaeApi.js and change the ip address assigned to the search_url variable.

Right now it's: const server_url = "http://10.0.0.107:8000";
It should be const server_url = "http://<your-ip>:8000";

Then open /CanvasApp in terminal and run <npm start> or <node server.js> to boot up the server. 
It will output the url to the client page, click on it to open. There you can now save and load images. 
Press ctrl C in the terminal to close the server. Without the server running, you will see in the client window that you cannot save or load images. 

